{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50916","headline":"谢赐待诏御苑（题拟） · 李建勳","name":"谢赐待诏御苑（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御苑赐房令待诏，此身殊胜到蓬瀛。\n禁中仙乐无时过，阶下常人不敢行。\n叠颖弄芳秋气落，丛柯耸翠露华清。\n天厨送食何功享，空咏康哉赞盛明。\n（见《江南余载》卷下。\n）（《江南余载》：李建勳罢相，元宗於西苑天全阁别置厅院待之，命右仆射孙晟因寓直焉。\n建勳进诗动云。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}